    <rdfs:label>Economy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">경제 — 경기, 물가, 금리, 산업 관련 주제</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#thresholdHigh">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#EvaluationDimension"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">높음 임계값</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_PluralPublicReason">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ValueAnchor"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PluralPublicReason</rdfs:label>
    <descriptionKo xml:lang="ko">단순 다수결이 아니라 다양한 의견이 구조적으로 반영되어야 한다는 기준</descriptionKo>
    <belongsToLayer rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#layer_social_meaning_proxy"/>
    <calibratesDimension rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#dim_consensus_deviation"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#publishedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Article"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Outlet"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기사를 발행 주체와 연결</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#RuleEngine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">외부 규칙을 실행하고 점수화하는 앱 엔진</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#EvidenceSpan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기사 내 판단 근거가 되는 문장/구절</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#evaluatedByEngine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#NewsArtifact"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#RuleEngine"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">뉴스 객체를 평가하는 앱 엔진</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#layer_social_meaning_proxy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#AxiomLayer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">국가 의미 인프라를 대체하는 임시 사회 의미 기준층</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#StanceVector">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기사 또는 기사 묶음의 논조 벡터</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#sig_M02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#DetectionSignature"/>
    <rdfs:label>M02 detection signature</rdfs:label>
    <signaturePrompt xml:lang="ko">동일한 행위나 기준을 진영별로 다르게 평가하는 정파적 기준 비대칭을 감지한다.</signaturePrompt>
    <positiveCue xml:lang="ko">진영별 평가 기준 비대칭, 동일 행위의 선택적 명명, 상대 진영 책임 강조</positiveCue>
    <negativeIndicator xml:lang="ko">동일 기준을 양측에 적용함, 진영보다 행위와 근거 수준을 중심으로 평가함</negativeIndicator>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ctx_WarSecurity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Topic"/>
    <rdfs:label>WarSecurity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전쟁/안보 — 군사, 국방, 안보 위협 관련 주제</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_OverSampling">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>OverSampling</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">과잉 표집 — 소수의 극단적 사례를 과도하게 노출하여 전체의 경향성으로 일반화하는 프레임</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#NewsArtifact">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">뉴스 평가의 대상이 되는 정보 객체의 상위 클래스</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ctx_Judiciary">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Topic"/>
    <rdfs:label>Judiciary</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사법 — 재판, 판결, 검찰, 법원 관련 주제</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ctx_Welfare">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Topic"/>
    <rdfs:label>Welfare</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">복지 — 사회복지, 연금, 의료보장 관련 주제</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ctx_PublicHealth">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Topic"/>
    <rdfs:label>PublicHealth</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">공중보건 — 감염병, 의료 정책, 백신 관련 주제</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#layer_temporal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#AxiomLayer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">시계열 정합성 기준층</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_ContextOmission">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>ContextOmission</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_SelectiveMemory">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>SelectiveMemory</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선택적 회상 — 현재 논조에 유리한 과거 보도만 인용하고 불리한 보도는 생략하는 프레임</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_UnverifiedClaim">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>UnverifiedClaim</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">미검증 주장 — 출처가 불분명하거나 검증되지 않은 사실을 단정적으로 보도하는 프레임</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_EmotionalAppeal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>EmotionalAppeal</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">감정 호소 — 객관적 근거 대신 자극적 어휘와 감정에 의존하여 판단을 방해하는 프레임</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#verdict_caution">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Verdict"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">주의 필요</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_PreemptiveDiscrediting">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label>PreemptiveDiscrediting</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선제적 깎아내리기 — 반론 출처를 내용 검토 전에 동기/정체성으로 공격하여 무력화하는 프레임</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <!-- ================================================================ -->
  <!-- VALUE-RELATIONAL EXTENSIONS (v2 patch)                             -->
  <!--                                                                    -->
  <!-- 두 종류의 관계를 추가:                                             -->
  <!-- 1. reinforces (Value -> Value): 같은 메타 가치의 다른 측면들을     -->
  <!--    그래프에서 강화 관계로 명시                                     -->
  <!-- 2. conflictsWith (Value -> Frame): ValueAnchor가 어떤 Frame과       -->
  <!--    구조적으로 충돌하는지 명시 (이것이 시계열 정합성 검증의 핵심)   -->
  <!-- ================================================================ -->

  <!-- ObjectProperty 정의 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#reinforces">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ValueAnchor"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ValueAnchor"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">강화 관계</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">두 ValueAnchor가 같은 메타 가치의 다른 측면임을 나타낸다. 충돌이 아니라 상호 강화.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>

  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#conflictsWith">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#ValueAnchor"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#Frame"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">구조적 충돌 관계</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">ValueAnchor가 그 Frame과 구조적으로 양립할 수 없음을 나타낸다. 시계열 비교에서, 과거 텍스트가 옹호한 Value를 현재 텍스트의 Frame이 위반하면 정합성 위반으로 본다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <!-- reinforces (Value -> Value): 강화 관계                -->
  <!-- 모든 ValueAnchor는 메타 가치 "보도 정합성"의 측면이므로 -->
  <!-- 서로를 강화하는 구조. 핵심 강화 관계만 명시.            -->
  <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_StanceConsistency">
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_FrameAccountability"/>
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_EvidenceTransparency"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ContextCompleteness">
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_FrameAccountability"/>
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_EvidenceTransparency"/>
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ResponsibilitySeparation"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_PluralPublicReason">
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_FrameAccountability"/>
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ContextCompleteness"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ResponsibilitySeparation">
    <reinforces rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_FrameAccountability"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <!-- conflictsWith (Value -> Frame): 구조적 충돌 관계      -->
  <!-- 이것이 시계열 정합성 검증의 그래프 추론 근거가 된다.   -->
  <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <!-- StanceConsistency: 시계열 설명 책임 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_StanceConsistency">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_SilentPivot"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_RetroactiveReframing"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_SelectiveMemory"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_HistoricalAmnesia"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- ContextCompleteness: 맥락 완결성 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ContextCompleteness">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_ContextOmission"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_HistoricalAmnesia"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_CherryPicking"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- EvidenceTransparency: 근거 투명성 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_EvidenceTransparency">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_UnverifiedClaim"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_CherryPicking"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_PreemptiveDiscrediting"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- FrameAccountability: 프레임 효과 평가 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_FrameAccountability">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_EmotionalAppeal"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_LogicalFallacy"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_CrisisInflation"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_OverSampling"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- ResponsibilitySeparation: 책임 분리 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_ResponsibilitySeparation">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_VictimBlaming"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_ResponsibilityShift"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_ConflictAmplification"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- PluralPublicReason: 다양성의 구조적 반영 -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#val_PluralPublicReason">
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_FalseBalance"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_PartisanBias"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_PreemptiveDiscrediting"/>
    <conflictsWith rdf:resource="http://www.context-sync.com/ontology/news-app#frame_InstitutionalDistrust"/>
  </rdf:Description>

</rdf:RDF>
